==Ossetian==

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|os||*дан}} (attested in placenames, and compare {{cog|ysc|dan}}) with ''a'' → ''o'' before a nasal, from {{inh|os|ira-pro|*dānu}} (compare {{cog|ae|𐬛𐬁𐬥𐬎|t=river}}), from {{inh|os|iir-pro|*dānu}} (compare {{cog|sa|दानु|t=drop, dew}}).

===Noun===
